1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:03,590
I have always been a unique soul.

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:09,950
And that is why I wrote a kid's book about being authentic.

3
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:18,230
We know that living our true authentic selves is really the only way to live in our greatest joy.

4
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:25,750
And kids are the best at being authentic, which is why we should be encouraging them to remain that way.

5
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:29,950
A kid's book about being authentic will be available October 27th.

